    "description": "Every board keyed by board name, each an array of ranked subnet entries capped at limit. Opaque JSON like HealthTrends.windows: the keys are dynamic AND hyphenated (fastest-rpc, most-complete, open-slots, \u2026) so they are not expressible as GraphQL field names, and each board carries its own metric columns (healthiest has uptime_ratio/surfaces_ok, fastest-rpc has latency_ms, fastest-growing has completeness_delta, \u2026). Passing it through verbatim keeps the REST/MCP get_registry_leaderboards shape byte-for-byte.",
